---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
import { u } from '../lib/url';
---
<Base title="Our story" description="Market Europa Moorabbin is a family-run continental supermarket with café in Melbourne's south east." current="/about">
  <div class="wrap section">
    <span class="eyebrow">Our story</span>
    <h1>A family-run continental supermarket</h1>
    <p>Market Europa is a family-run continental supermarket in the Moorabbin and Kingston area with an on-site café. Fresh fruit and veg every day, a deli and cheese cabinet, in-house butchers, fresh seafood, pasta and gnocchi handmade in the market, bakery and pastry, and the European pantry brands our customers grew up with.</p>
    <p>[Family story, year established, the people behind the counters and the suppliers you are proud of: to be written with the store.]</p>
    <p>We are members of A Better Choice, the independent fresh-food retailers' program.</p>
    <p><a class="btn" href={u('/visit')}>Plan your visit</a> <a class="btn ghost" href={u('/specials')}>This week's specials</a></p>
    <p>Our sister store: <a href={site.sisterStore.url} rel="noopener">{site.sisterStore.name}</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
